<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <h1 style="color: #111827;">Welcome to EventzFlow!</h1>
  <p>Your exhibitor account is ready. Sign in to manage your booths, update exhibitor details where available, add team members, and order items and services.</p>
  <div style="background: #f3f4f6; border-radius: 8px; padding: 18px; margin: 24px 0;">
    <p style="margin: 0 0 8px;"><strong>Email:</strong> <%= @email %></p>
    <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>Temporary password:</strong> <%= @temporary_password %></p>
  </div>
  <p><a href="<%= @login_url %>" style="background: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; display: inline-block; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;">Log in to EventzFlow</a></p>
  <p>For security, please update your password promptly after signing in.</p>
  <p>We look forward to helping you prepare for your event.</p>
</div>
